stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Visitor
    Visitor: 到访
    InvitedReserved: 已邀请并预留住房
    Arriving: 前往小镇
    MovingIn: 入住中
    Resident: 已入住居民

    Visitor --> InvitedReserved: 确认邀请
    InvitedReserved --> Arriving: 住房和道路可用
    Arriving --> MovingIn: 到达住房
    MovingIn --> Resident: 入住完成

    state Resident {
        [*] --> AtHome
        AtHome: 在家
        Leisure: 生活活动
        AssignedReady: 岗位待命
        Reserving: 预留任务资源
        PathRequested: 请求路径
        Walking: 通勤或搬运
        Queueing: 安全排队
        Working: 执行作业
        OutputReady: 产出就绪
        Carrying: 搬运货物
        Depositing: 存放或装载
        TaskComplete: 任务完成
        Blocked: 阻塞
        Interrupted: 中断快照

        AtHome --> Leisure: 无任务
        Leisure --> AssignedReady: 工作时段
        AssignedReady --> Reserving: 领取任务
        Reserving --> PathRequested: 预留成功
        Reserving --> Blocked: 预留失败
        PathRequested --> Walking: 路径存在
        PathRequested --> Blocked: 无路
        Walking --> Queueing: 作业点忙
        Walking --> Working: 到达
        Queueing --> Working: 作业点释放
        Working --> OutputReady: 作业完成
        OutputReady --> Carrying: 有配送目标
        OutputReady --> Blocked: 输出满
        Carrying --> Depositing: 到达目标
        Depositing --> TaskComplete: 原子存放成功
        Depositing --> Blocked: 目标阻塞
        TaskComplete --> AssignedReady: 下一任务
        TaskComplete --> Leisure: 无任务
        Leisure --> AtHome: 日程结束
        Blocked --> AssignedReady: 条件恢复
        Walking --> Interrupted: 切后台
        Working --> Interrupted: 切后台
        Carrying --> Interrupted: 切后台
        Interrupted --> AssignedReady: 恢复安全状态
    }
